# Normalize line endings so the bundle is byte-identical on every OS: the
# build inlines .css and .ts file contents (esbuild text loader), so CRLF in
# the working tree leaks CRLF into dist/main.js. That made the committed root
# main.js and a CI build disagree byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
